                                                            <b>Brief Profile:</b><br>

                                                            <strong>Prof (Dr) Surabhi Singh</strong> is a dynamic
                                                            academic administrator
                                                            and management professional with over <strong>25 years of
                                                                experience</strong>, comprising over <strong>17 years in
                                                                higher education and
                                                                8 years in the corporate sector.</strong> Proven
                                                            expertise in
                                                            academic leadership, institutional development,
                                                            accreditation processes, research management, industry
                                                            collaborations, international relations, student engagement,
                                                            faculty development, admissions, branding, and strategic
                                                            academic planning.
                                                            <br>

                                                            Successfully led MBA/BBA programs, established Centres of
                                                            Excellence, strengthened industry-academia collaborations,
                                                            managed accreditation initiatives including NBA and NAAC,
                                                            and contributed extensively towards institutional growth,
                                                            research excellence, placements, and academic governance.

                                                            <br>
                                                            Recognised for building collaborative academic ecosystems,
                                                            enhancing institutional visibility, promoting innovation and
                                                            entrepreneurship, and driving quality-assurance initiatives
                                                            in higher education. Currently she serves as Professor and
                                                            Dean-Global Engagement and International Relations in GNOIT
                                                            Institute of Management of Studies Greater Noida.
